<title>UK: SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-LEADING SCORERS IN ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the English</p>
<p>premier league after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>14 - Ian Wright (Arsenal)</p>
<p>10 - Robbie Fowler (Liverpool), Alan Shearer (Newcastle)</p>
<p>9 - Fabrizio Ravanelli (Middlesbrough)</p>
<p>8 - Matthew Le Tissier (Southampton), Ole Gunnar Solskjaer</p>
<p>(Manchester United), Dwight Yorke (Aston Villa), Efan</p>
<p>Ekoku (Wimbledon), Gianluca Vialli (Chelsea)</p>
<p>7 - Les Ferdinand (Newcastle), Robbie Earle (Wimbledon)</p>
</text>
